  "title": "erpax — a zero-entropy, content-addressed ERP corpus",
  "description": "<p>erpax is an ERP corpus in which every folder under <code>src/</code> is one irreducible atom told three ways (form &middot; code &middot; proof), wired through a single content-uuid. Its law is <em>zero entropy &rArr; infinite tamper-cost</em>: a claim is enforced by a gate that blocks its violation, never by prose that asks for compliance.</p><p>Licensed CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 throughout, with commercial terms available separately.</p>",
